{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121162","id":4028926108,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7wJIic","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121162","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121162.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121162.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121162","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121162/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121162/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121162/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1b5c78c822a665c5794d9b5ab20650133a273e44","number":121162,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add plugin selection, reload functionality, and custom status UI to plugin settings","user":{"login":"DexterFstone","id":92402263,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYHyVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92402263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone","html_url":"https://github.com/DexterFstone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Alternative to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112086\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13308\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nThis PR changes the status column title to `status` and removes the checkboxes; instead, it now relies on a button that resembles the real state, green and `Enabled` text when the addon is enabled, and red and `Disabled` text when the addon is disabled. Clicking on the button changes the status\r\nA `downarrow` flag was added to `TreeItem` to be able to remove the `downarrow` icon when using a custom button. Methods:\r\n```c++\r\nvoid set_downarrow(int p_column, bool p_enabled);\r\nbool has_downarrow(int p_column) const;\r\n```\r\nA new column is added that resembles selected addons with checkboxes (no title included)\r\nA new `Reload Plugins` button has been added as well, with the default shortcut `Alt+Shift+R,` that accessible through the entire editor. To achieve it, I used `EditorNode::_shortcut_input`\r\nI also centered the status, version, and edit columns.\r\n## Overview:\r\nWhen there are no selected addons, the reload button is disabled.\r\n<img width=\"1505\" height=\"911\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30352c7e-d349-4be3-89b2-cb344a1b8924\" />\r\nAfter selecting addons, the reload button becomes enabled.\r\n<img width=\"1505\" height=\"911\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d7795f1-7107-4300-99ab-3858e247c3c7\" />\r\nAfter pressing `Reload Plugins`, disabled addons become enabled.\r\n<img width=\"1505\" height=\"911\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5068f574-41b1-4978-afc6-06c82db30765\" />\r\nPressing the status button changes the status of that addon.\r\n<img width=\"1505\" height=\"911\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6f83862-b22d-4df6-ae48-332649b2ca45\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMD